# The npm lockfile IS committed again (2026-09-06). It must be generated on
# LINUX -- run the `Lockfile (Linux-on generalva)` workflow and commit its
# artifact. A Windows-generated lock silently drops the nested @emnapi entries of
# the wasm32 optional branches (sharp / @tailwindcss/oxide / rolldown), and then
# `npm ci` fails on Linux. `scripts/check-lockfile.mjs` measures exactly that, and
# CI runs it. See DEPLOY.md §5.
